// memory: 34 34
// An arena around a body that allocates nothing allocates nothing either.
// Its arms never run, so the install's row is its body's and main carries
// no Alloc. The memory is the 34 pages the start needs, 32 of them the
// arenas' journal, and it never grows. The boot before this landing charged
// the install with Alloc and declared 34 pages that could grow to 65,536.
import arena

fn main() = memory_pages() ~> arena
